    "Scan of the 1959 edition of the Vine Hill, California, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1950; aerial photographs from 1979; field checked in 1959; photo revised in 1980; last revised in 1979; printed in 1986.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.5 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Universal Transverse Mercator; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
